            "tb-continue-context"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-continue-definition",
        "moduleId": "continue-rule",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材定义",
        "markdown": "`continue` 语句用以告诉 Python 跳过当前循环块中的剩余语句，并继续该循环的下一次迭代。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "quote",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-02a2660bfbda114ce9f016b3",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000072"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "控制流",
                "<sub>continue</sub> 语句"
              ],
              "lineStart": 644,
              "lineEnd": 653,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "4b21bcd0fd3e3ebb6b3cea122c9ba05f451b1ecfe37805567c89f618e069f58c"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-rule-scope",
        "moduleId": "continue-rule",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充解释：跳过的范围",
        "markdown": "“当前循环块”指本次迭代中 `continue` 之后、仍属于同一循环体的语句；这些语句不会在本轮执行。“下一次迭代”意味着循环继续：`while` 会重新检查循环条件，`for` 会取序列中的下一个元素，循环本身并未被终止。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-continue-definition"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-break-comparison",
        "moduleId": "continue-rule",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "comparison",
        "title": "与 break 的区别",
        "markdown": "`continue` 与 `break` 都写在循环体内，但结束的范围不同：`continue` 只结束当前这一轮，循环仍会继续；`break` 结束整个循环，即使循环条件仍为真或序列尚未遍历完。判断代码行为时，先确认语句属于哪个循环体，再确认它让执行位置去往下一轮还是循环之后。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-continue-definition",
            "model-rule-scope"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
